      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of trying to recreate grapheme detection I can use a grapheme break iterator to limit emoji detection to a single grapheme. That would remove the case of \"99\" (reducing it to \"9\") but keep flag emoji.\nWithin a single grapheme (cluster) I can check that the first codepoint is emoji-not-component or it requires another codepoint if it\u0027s emoji-and-component.",
